@model DeploymentPortal.Services.AutomationOptions
@{ ViewData["Title"] = "Settings"; }
<div class="page-heading"><div><div class="eyebrow">WORKSPACE CONFIGURATION</div><h1>Settings</h1><p>Deployment boundaries configured on the dashboard host.</p></div><span class="environment">Read only</span></div>
<section class="panel max-form"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>Automation policy</h2></div><dl class="detail-grid"><dt>Source / target folders</dt><dd>Chosen per deployment. Protected system paths, overlapping folders and links are rejected.</dd><dt>Backup root</dt><dd class="font-monospace">@Model.BackupRoot</dd><dt>Connection timeout</dt><dd>@Model.ConnectionTimeoutSeconds seconds</dd><dt>Deployment timeout</dt><dd>@Model.DeploymentTimeoutSeconds seconds (+60 seconds process allowance)</dd><dt>Credential provider</dt><dd>Development-only host-specific user secrets</dd></dl><div class="form-body pt-0"><div class="alert alert-warning mb-0">Phase 1 has no authentication. Run locally or within an isolated, trusted test network. Development credentials are not a production secret store.</div></div></section>
